      "id": "claim_53bb7401e0214d36ae0249e90fe94e42",
      "statement": "The repository requires Python 3.13+, Node.js, and uv package manager. `make install` installs Python dependencies via `uv sync --all-groups`, local npm packages, and the Mintlify CLI globally, retrying a failed global Mint installation up to three times before failing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Makefile#L123-L139",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aeb6fb5d6edafb63623c0bbf2352a3cd222258a400c8597982d064b60e7b92ca:"
        },
        {
